      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll do header fixes in a follow-up to try to land this and unblock the rest of wgpu::StringView work. I\u0027m having trouble landing things with the timezone roundtrips for code review and it makes the patch stacks longer and harder to manage.",
      "parentUuid": "2ec8cf64_777b56c7",
      "revId": "17cada87d0e00341124329cf79c5523f73342b4d",
