      "writtenOn": "2024-09-25T14:56:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Turns out fixing in C++ is complex because adding ` \u003d {}` in args requires that `StringView`\u0027s definition be visible earlier, but we define structures after objects so that we can use objects in structures.",
      "parentUuid": "60b6a39a_7509b614",
      "revId": "17cada87d0e00341124329cf79c5523f73342b4d",
