      "writtenOn": "2024-09-25T19:03:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I should have been clearer, `SetLabel()` without args doesn\u0027t need to be valid (probably shouldn\u0027t be valid), since labels are non-nullable in the WebIDL.\n\nBut `SetLabel({})` should work (nil defaults to empty string somewhere, but it doesn\u0027t matter what layer that defaulting happens at).",
      "parentUuid": "2e7f9c18_d554d3df",
      "revId": "17cada87d0e00341124329cf79c5523f73342b4d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
